"tapHoldBuffering.description" = "Switches languages even when you tap Shift and type so quickly that the letter goes down before Shift comes up. On keys where Shift means nothing (Korean keys other than the double consonants, every Japanese letter) it always switches. Double consonants (ㄲㄸㅃㅆㅉㅒㅖ) and English capitals switch only when Shift comes up very quickly (within 30 ms), and a double consonant in the middle of a Korean word never does.";

